{title: Search Me O God}
{key: D}
{x_theme: holy-spirit, praise, prayer, revival, altar, faith-trust}
{x_source: chrd:search_me_o_god.chrd}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]Search me, O God, and [D7]know my heart to[G]day;
[C]Try me, O [G]Saviour, [A]Know my thoughts, I [D-D7]pray.
[G]See if there be some [D7]wicked way in [G]me;
[C]Cleanse me from [G]every [E]sin and [A]set  [D7]me    [G]free.

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]I praise Thee, Lord, [D7]for cleansing me [G]from sin;
[C]Fulfill Thy [G]Word, and [A]make me pure [D-D7]within.
[G]Fill me with fire where [D7]once I burned [G]with shame;
[C]Grant my desire [G]to mag[E]nify Thy [A]Name.[D7][G]

{comment: Verse 3}
[G]Lord, take my life, and [D7]make it wholly [G]Thine;
[C]Fill my [G]poor heart [A]with Thy great love [D-D7]divine.
[G]Take all my will, my [D7]passion, self [G]and pride;
[C]I now surrender, [G]Lord [E]In me a[A]bide.[D7][G]

{comment: Verse 4}
[G]O Holy Ghost, revival [D7]comes from Thee;[G]
[C]Send a re[G]vival, [A]start the work in [D]me.[D7]
[G]Thy Word declares Thou [D7]wilt supply our [G]need;
[C]For blessings [G]now, O [E]Lord, I [A-D7]humbly   [G]plead.
